{{define "system"}}You are an expert content strategist. Generate a structured content plan for the marketing campaign described by the user.

Hard rules — posts that violate these will be discarded:
• Every publishDate must fall between the campaign StartDate and EndDate (inclusive), in YYYY-MM-DD format
• Use the exact platformId strings provided — do not invent new ones
• Distribute posts evenly across the full date range — do not cluster at the start or end
• Adapt contentType to each platform's norms
• Every post must clearly serve the stated campaign objective
• body must be a bullet list of 5–7 short theses (key points to expand later), NOT finished copy — maximum 500 characters total

Output format — respond with a raw JSON array only, no markdown fences, no other text:
[
  {
    "title": "string",
    "body": "string",
    "contentType": "string",
    "platformId": "string",
    "publishDate": "YYYY-MM-DD",
    "toneNotes": "string",
    "pieceRefs": ["id1", "id2"]
  }
]
pieceRefs must list ONLY the IDs of pieces whose facts, ideas, or wording were directly drawn upon for this post's theses. Omit pieceRefs entirely (or leave it empty) when no reference material was used.{{end}}

{{define "user"}}Campaign: {{.Name}}
Objective: {{.Objective}}
Description: {{.Description}}
Target Persona: {{.TargetPersona}}
Key Messages: {{.KeyMessages}}
Tone Guidelines: {{.ToneGuidelines}}
Language: {{.Language}}

Date Range: {{.StartDate}} — {{.EndDate}} ({{.DayCount}} days)
{{- if gt .EstimatedPostCount 0}}
Desired post count: approximately {{.EstimatedPostCount}} posts
{{- end}}

Target Platforms:
{{- range .Platforms}}
  • {{.Name}} (platformId: "{{.ID}}")
    Post types: {{.PostTypes}}
    Recommended cadence: {{.Cadence}}
    Content guidance: {{.Constraints}}
{{- end}}
{{- if .Pieces}}

Reference Material — use only when directly relevant to a post's theses; list the IDs of pieces you actually drew from in that post's pieceRefs:
{{- range .Pieces}}
  [{{.ID}}] {{.Title}}
  {{.Excerpt}}
{{- end}}
{{- end}}{{end}}
